WEBVTT

00:46:59.243 --> 00:47:00.919
by the importance of work?

00:47:00.943 --> 00:47:05.696
But what makes us happy in the world
is our family and loved ones.

00:47:05.720 --> 00:47:09.263
And those are things that AI cannot do.

00:47:09.704 --> 00:47:14.506
So on the AI-induced job displacement,

00:47:14.530 --> 00:47:17.172
we should think about,

00:47:17.196 --> 00:47:21.847
"Well, maybe it isn't AI taking
the jobs away, we're in trouble,

00:47:21.871 --> 00:47:28.300
maybe it is AI being sent here
by God or our collective will

00:47:28.324 --> 00:47:30.705
to remove the routine jobs